      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CALLAHAN (7) finished sixth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 390m at this track, taking a Grade 4/5 in a speedy 22.15. Hot win two back and looks the one to beat here. ASCEND IGLOO (4) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 3.5 lengths fourth (22.74) over 390m at this track. Deserves plenty of respect. SUTA'S DELIGHT (2) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 22.57 beating Lakeview Mitch. Leading player again. PAW QUEBEC (6) was a winner two back then strongly fancied last time but could only manage a third (22.71) at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start.",
